# REQUIRES: cuda
# Same-frame forces and energy of alanine dipeptide in OPC (NPT) and in
# TIP3P (NVT), PME, with heavy-atom solute units: at ten frames of a
# template trajectory, template against general double within 1.5 times
# general mixed's error or 1e-5 of the largest force (projected forces,
# and the solute's atom forces unprojected), energy within 1.5 times
# mixed's or 1e-6 relative.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t/opc %t/tip3p
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/water_template_solute.py %S/Inputs %t/opc OPC NPT 200
# RUN: mdir-template-solute-test %t/opc/control.toml 10 | tee %t/opc/metrics.txt | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/water_template_solute.py %S/Inputs %t/tip3p TIP3P NVT 200
# RUN: mdir-template-solute-test %t/tip3p/control.toml 10 | tee %t/tip3p/metrics.txt | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: frame 20 volume
# CHECK: frame 200 volume
# CHECK: solvated solute template frames passed
